    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6754" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carcĕrārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a prison</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quaestus,</span>”
