				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Capt. 1, 2, 20</span></i>
			.—Hence, <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carcĕrārĭus</span></b> ,
			ii, m., <i>a
			prisonkeeper</i>, <i>jailer</i>, <i><span class="en">Inscr.
					Grut. 80, 5</span></i>; Don. ad <i><span class="en">Ter. Phorm.
				2, 3, 26</span></i>; cf. carcer, I. C. b.</div>
